  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "en": "Ken and his friend Mia often walked home together after school.",
          "ja": "ケンと友人ミアは放課後よく一緒に歩いて帰った。"
        },
        {
          "en": "One day, Mia asked Ken to wait for her outside the classroom.",
          "ja": "ある日ミアは教室の外で待つようケンに頼んだ。"
        },
        {
          "en": "She said she would return in ten minutes.",
          "ja": "10分で戻ると言った。"
        },
        {
          "en": "Ken agreed because he had no plans that afternoon.",
          "ja": "その午後予定がなかったのでケンは同意した。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "en": "Thirty minutes later, Mia was still busy with her club activity.",
          "ja": "30分後、ミアはまだ部活動で忙しかった。"
        },
        {
          "en": "Ken began to worry about missing his bus.",
          "ja": "ケンはバスに乗り遅れることを心配し始めた。"
        },
        {
          "en": "He sent her a short message before leaving.",
          "ja": "出発前に短いメッセージを送った。"
        },
        {
          "en": "Mia read it when she finally finished her work.",
          "ja": "ミアはようやく作業を終えたとき読んだ。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "en": "The next morning, Mia apologized to Ken.",
          "ja": "翌朝ミアはケンに謝った。"
        },
        {
          "en": "She explained that the club activity had taken longer than expected.",
          "ja": "部活動が予想より長引いたと説明した。"
        },
        {
          "en": "Ken understood, but he asked her to send a message next time.",
          "ja": "ケンは理解したが次回は連絡するよう頼んだ。"
        },
        {
          "en": "He wanted to know when he could leave.",
          "ja": "いつ出発できるか知りたかった。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "en": "A week later, they made another plan to walk home.",
          "ja": "一週間後、再び一緒に帰る計画を立てた。"
        },
        {
          "en": "This time, Mia knew she might have extra work.",
          "ja": "今度は追加作業があるかもしれないと分かっていた。"
        },
        {
          "en": "She told Ken to leave if she was not ready by four.",
          "ja": "4時までに準備できなければ帰るよう伝えた。"
        },
        {
          "en": "Ken thanked her for the clear plan.",
          "ja": "ケンは明確な計画に感謝した。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p5",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "en": "Friends cannot always keep every plan unchanged.",
          "ja": "友人は常に全計画を変えずに保てるわけではない。"
        },
        {
          "en": "However, they can tell each other when something changes.",
          "ja": "しかし何かが変わったとき互いに伝えられる。"
        },
        {
          "en": "A short message can help both people use their time well.",
          "ja": "短い連絡は双方が時間をうまく使う助けになる。"
        },
        {
          "en": "Mia learned that friendship includes respecting another person's time.",
          "ja": "ミアは友情には相手の時間の尊重が含まれると学んだ。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
